### List households
POST {{baseApiPath}}/households/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "page": 3
}

### Search for households (name, address, phone, e-mail or household number - fuzzy)
# The term goes in the body, not a ?searchInput=... query parameter - see ADR-0057 (GDPR gap G25).
POST {{baseApiPath}}/households/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "searchInput": "muster"
}

### Search for households (fuzzy search combined with the filters)
POST {{baseApiPath}}/households/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "searchInput": "muster",
  "filters": {
    "valid": true,
    "costContribution": true
  }
}

### Search for households with no PRIVACY_NOTICE document uploaded
POST {{baseApiPath}}/households/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "filters": {
    "missingPrivacyNotice": true
  }
}

