### Income quick-check (minimal person data, same response as /validate)
POST {{baseApiPath}}/households/income-quickcheck
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "persons": [
    {
      "birthDate": "1990-01-01",
      "income": 1200.00
    },
    {
      "birthDate": "2015-01-01",
      "income": null,
      "receivesFamilyAllowance": true
    }
  ]
}

